    "enUS": {
      "description": "This murloc has no doubt been terrorizing the local roads for some time. You suspect the nearby watch guards will want to know of its demise.",
      "dialogue": {
        "110006b8f92bcc6512ad": "We lost two members of the watch last week to the murlocs, $c. Hopefully with their leader slain, we can start pushing them out of Elwynn.",
        "89197041db5b825feb90": "Yes?"
      },
      "summary": "Deliver Croaky's Head to Merell Ross at Ridgepoint Tower.",
      "title": "Croaky's Head",
